iness. Set prices, take care of bookings, respond to guest feedback, and keep everything running smoothly. Every decision counts \u2014 happy customers mean better reviews, and better reviews mean more bookings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.poster.avif?t=1757139571\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.webm?t=1757139571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.mp4?t=1757139571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fixing leaky faucets to decorating dream suites, every detail matters. Will your motel become the next hidden gem on the map? The keys are in your hands.</p>","developers":["Red Phoenix Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/a2c0525271326d88334c9eea26ebcbb89cf265c5/header.jpg?t=1757139571","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Red Phoenix Interactive. All rights reserved.  <br />\r\nUnreal Engine 5.3 \u00a9 2025 Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved.  ","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257147106,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147106/movie480.mp4?t=1748434688","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147106/movie_max.mp4?t=1748434688"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257147106/b9d96592326